{"23-25 高考考题精编:P04-Q14":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>2024·北京卷 · 碳酸钠</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">23-25 高考考题精编 · 专题04 常见无机物的性质、用途与转化 · 考法01 常见无机物的性质与用途 · 原第14题 · 2024·北京卷 · P04-Q14</div><h1>2024·北京卷 · 碳酸钠</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：常见无机物及其应用/钠及其化合物/碳酸钠</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：原资料定位为“考法01 常见无机物的性质与用途”；结合本题题干、选项和考查要求，主归类为“碳酸钠”。相关类别和小问标签用于跨专题检索。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>14．（2024·北京卷）关于<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:0;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:1;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的下列说法中，不正确的是（    ）</p><p>A．两种物质的溶液中，所含微粒的种类相同</p><p>B．可用<img src=\"chem-asset:be97c09e4c69b4e95733735cf3e27e782af2f600af6bfc9a01476cbb9c3eceb7:2;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液使<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:3;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:4;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C．利用二者热稳定性差异，可从它们的固体混合物中除去<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:5;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D．室温下，二者饱和溶液的<img src=\"chem-asset:5b96d57a42452037809d5fbe4f4fb317f25c4b4ce6f65da1dcb79304629c46f4:6;\" style=\"width:24.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">差约为4，主要是由于它们的溶解度差异</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:7;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:8;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的溶液中均存在<img src=\"chem-asset:7c2baf2285e55583d60c21307602ad1ca2b0cb04b00fe21753e47d5233cd385c:9;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:46aa9dc72e61c699e7a6a2b13210e1fdb0bb10f360c31416eaf32e0b04ff44b3:10;\" style=\"width:50.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:58c09d1cb35da46864bc389195f06eceaca69ad4446a04cae09f60bbfe5853c0:11;\" style=\"width:23.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:b28741aad1e1e636f495ce9a0ab45a40dd8f1f8d647439721da8cd88079843bb:12;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:547350d4fa65aec8eb6dd3cd4d0268a1849219e137a0f568f9ca65c58b27c3c5:13;\" style=\"width:30.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:5aefde33e4de29704f47355601e7c3770a80e16b52bee4b6b1a8efcf5a3abe50:14;\" style=\"width:42.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:48c5ff8a265e5c988ef2f911b9964f1a58f6ff262f89dfa414270cadfdfec35f:15;\" style=\"width:44.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A正确；<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:16;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">加入<img src=\"chem-asset:be97c09e4c69b4e95733735cf3e27e782af2f600af6bfc9a01476cbb9c3eceb7:17;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液会发生反应：<img src=\"chem-asset:edc0cc528362a3eb532babb292eef29594096ffb5e8463342162a360d233b57e:18;\" style=\"width:240.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B正确；<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:19;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">受热易分解，转化为<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:20;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，而<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:7;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">热稳定性较强，C正确；室温下<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:7;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:8;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">饱和溶液<img src=\"chem-asset:5b96d57a42452037809d5fbe4f4fb317f25c4b4ce6f65da1dcb79304629c46f4:21;\" style=\"width:24.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">相差较大的主要原因是<img src=\"chem-asset:fe0110d26743da894462d3edf073d35d2d0a51e0031023094080c75e900bd895:22;\" style=\"width:36.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的水解程度远大于<img src=\"chem-asset:48c5ff8a265e5c988ef2f911b9964f1a58f6ff262f89dfa414270cadfdfec35f:23;\" style=\"width:44.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误。</p><p>【归纳总结】除<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:24;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">固体中的少量<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:25;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">可采用加热的方法；除<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:26;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中的少量<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:27;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">可加入适量<img src=\"chem-asset:be97c09e4c69b4e95733735cf3e27e782af2f600af6bfc9a01476cbb9c3eceb7:28;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液；除<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:27;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中的少量<img src=\"chem-asset:dd2daf2bf7071b87755a08d0dd19e61099a83c0414c018a059aa0830a0fda364:20;\" style=\"width:58.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">可通入足量<img src=\"chem-asset:e2321ff515b9e17ebf1030976351f7fc4ad98be6f4939b08ca22e07d06a8b22f:29;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">气体。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\23-25 高考考题精编\\专题04 常见无机物的性质、用途与转化（全国通用）-【好题汇编】三年（2023-2025）高考化学真题分类汇编\\专题04 常见无机物的性质、用途与转化\\专题04 常见无机物的性质、用途与转化（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/23-25%20%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E8%80%83%E9%A2%98%E7%B2%BE%E7%BC%96/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9804%20%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E6%97%A0%E6%9C%BA%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E3%80%81%E7%94%A8%E9%80%94%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89-%E3%80%90%E5%A5%BD%E9%A2%98%E6%B1%87%E7%BC%96%E3%80%91%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%882023-2025%EF%BC%89%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E6%B1%87%E7%BC%96/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9804%20%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E6%97%A0%E6%9C%BA%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E3%80%81%E7%94%A8%E9%80%94%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9804%20%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E6%97%A0%E6%9C%BA%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E3%80%81%E7%94%A8%E9%80%94%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["46aa9dc72e61c699e7a6a2b13210e1fdb0bb10f360c31416eaf32e0b04ff44b3","4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040","48c5ff8a265e5c988ef2f911b9964f1a58f6ff262f89dfa414270cadfdfec35f","547350d4fa65aec8eb6dd3cd4d0268a1849219e137a0f568f9ca